WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:00.700
China may

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.135
be one step closer

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.670
to attacking Taiwan,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.204
staging

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:06.006
massive military exercises

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.108
miles off the Taiwanese coast.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.210
Senior defense officials in Taipei say

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.112
12 Chinese warships

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.613
surrounded the island,

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.149
simulating a sea and air blockade

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:19.285
for the second time in eight months.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.787
Taiwan's military says

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:21.654
three days

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:22.489
of war games

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.224
reveal rapid progress

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.625
by the Chinese Navy,

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:26.292
what appear

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:26.693
to be

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.727
the first ever

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.630
simulations of aircraft carrier strikes

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.065
with a highly advanced

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.933
J 15 fighter fleet.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.402
China calls the flying

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:37.237
shark on the Taiwan Strait.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.271
China's Shandong

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.272
aircraft carrier

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.240
launched 80

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.541
fighter jet missions

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.676
and 40 helicopter flights.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.812
The drills came with an ominous warning.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.448
China's military is ready to fight

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:49.549
the Taiwanese

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.483
military issuing

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.185
a strong condemnation,

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:54.220
saying it does not seek to escalate

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.356
but is determined to safeguard

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:57.557
its sovereignty.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.459
Is Beijing, in your view,

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.661
threatening Taiwan with war?

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:02.762
Yes, indeed.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.397
Taiwan's foreign minister, Joseph

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.131
Wu, speaking

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.866
exclusively to CNN,

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.002
condemning China's military moves,

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.670
menacing imagery shows

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.138
a barrage of ballistic

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.007
missiles aimed at the island.

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.642
China launched real missiles

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.144
over Taiwan for the first time last year.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:19.712
Look at military sites

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.082
exercises and also the rhetoric.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.151
They seem to be trying to get ready

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.420
to launch a war against Taiwan.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.655
China calls the drills

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:29.923
a serious warning

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.124
against the Taiwan

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.926
separatist forces, collusion

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.627
with external forces

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.495
and a necessary

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.530
move to defend national sovereignty

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.799
and territorial integrity.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:40.934
Chinese exercises,

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.436
like similar drills last August followed

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.472
high profile meetings with U.S.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.606
House speakers

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.475
Nancy Pelosi in Taiwan,

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.510
Kevin McCarthy in California.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.744
Meetings the foreign minister

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:53.079
calls crucial

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.247
to counter decades

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.950
of diplomatic isolation by Beijing.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.686
China cannot dictate

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.988
how Taiwan make friends

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.692
in China cannot dictate how our friends

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.861
want to show support to Taiwan.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.129
Support includes

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.563
nine rounds of weapons

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.631
sales to the island.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.533
Under the Biden administration alone.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.101
U.S.

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.836
intelligence believes the People's

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:17.804
Liberation Army

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.939
is acting on orders from President

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.608
Xi Jinping himself.

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:24.811
The PLA told to be ready by 2027

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:28.248
to take Taiwan by force one U.S.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.115
general claiming

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.917
it could happen even sooner

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.820
in 2020 52 years from now

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:34.621
a war

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:37.190
that could involve the US and its allies

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:38.825
as this fragile island

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.560
democracy fights to fend off

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.262
a future Chinese attack.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:45.031
And next time it may not be a drill

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.736
but there are concerns tonight

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.970
that global democracies

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.905
may not be united,

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:53.339
particularly after these comments

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:53.840
from the French

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.475
President, Emmanuel Macron,

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:56.709
on the heels of his state visit

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:57.610
to Beijing.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.512
He almost was echoing the Chinese

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.214
President Xi Jinping's talking points.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:01.714
He was

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:02.982
cautioning Europe against

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:05.084
being drawn into a Taiwan crisis,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.287
saying that Europe should resist pressure

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.722
to be a follower of America.

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:11.491
Well, here in Taipei, of course,

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:12.725
lawmakers are asking

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.194
why would an advanced

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.228
democratic country

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:16.095
ignore the lives

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.397
and potential deaths of people

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:18.698
in other countries?

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:19.899
They really say that those comments

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:20.867
are puzzling Erica.

